ny of school and life, he prays for change, for something exciting. Suddenly, he and his classmates are forced to play deadly children's games and facing terrifying creatures from a talking Daruma doll to a sharp-clawed lucky cat.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1171462,\"title\":\"Golden Kamuy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sLcRGIJqlJeoGGk88CtA8Ida5aq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zU79dkIicO6nipT5Ypr1RmWbZN2.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the Hokkaido frontier, a war veteran and Ainu girl race against misfits and military renegades to find treasure mapped out on tattooed outlaws.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14943,\"title\":\"Crows Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/so1E9wUAXJi9hqGRNPgoVQd7HaX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43FpZytJjlReDAPrByR77i81mnr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The students of Suzuran High compete for the King of School title. An ex-graduate yakuza is sent to kill the son of a criminal group, but he can't make himself do it as he reminds him of his youth.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663113,\"title\":\"Patalliro! The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qR17ndNiqh3hvlzSG9PEoI7M1rD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSqDOIXckuDCLSudWJxYBMDJ8Ah.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Patalliro du Malyner VIII is the crown prince of Malynera, a kingdom that produces diamonds. Despite being ugly and mischievous, he is loyal and fair. Many enemies of the throne, including Malynera's Prime Minister, plan to get rid of him and take control of the rich nation. Patalliro, however, has the protection of Jack Barbarosa Bancoran, his haughty and extremely handsome bodyguard, who will protect him even from the latter's own lover, the beautiful bishonen hitman Maraich Juschenfe and other assassins.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1043884,\"title\":\"From Today, It’s My Turn!!: Special\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iPBDshNIJwERHljEr5Q6mrxKyEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jzkfQF4UBKUeAYQyk4P0YVV34fa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three years after the event of the series, Takashi Mitsuhashi and Shinji Ito face the new enemies.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":724273,\"title\":\"Kiss Him, Not Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oCocxd4GeHNcaHa2BsCedkdSGHr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXnkikJAopxrHPPP4DyrCONEb8R.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kae is a fat high school girl who is a 'fujoshi', which is girls who enjoy reading homosexual romance novels. She is dismayed when her favourite character is killed off. She is unwell and refuses to eat. She loses weight. As a side-effect she is thin and suddenly popular at school. Boys begin to pursue her. She has a choice of suitors and can pick a boy of her liking. They are all pretty.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":530282,\"title\":\"Samurai Sensei\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l6tEBf33yylR54meYg9WpG04awB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qCFUwHrjsOuHkAF8NmQeqfdRF01.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hanpeita Takeichi, a samurai, finds that he has travelled through time to modern-day Japan. He's taken in by an old man who runs a cram school, and begins to work as a teacher there.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":534326,\"title\":\"You, I Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/exXVkl4cdqqdqR8Dp8HE9snA9mg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/egM5YvTHZFdV7kAXhRej4whABGE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rin, Yuu, Koyomi and Keita are friends in high school who live in the same apartment building. Rin and Yuu like each other, but they don’t tell each other, until Kazuma shows up.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":544810,\"title\":\"That Girl's Captives of Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hkECP4uy91M7DsDQntoXd7ywlvR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ne4x0KWqKSNXJHyibvsuOaS4TlX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Centers on three childhood friends in a love triangle. Yori moved back to the countryside, and started wearing glasses and not being noticed by girls. Meanwhile, Shizuku entered the entertainment industry alongside Subaru, and both began working as a model and actor, respectively. But when Yori turns 16, he re-enters their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":353284,\"title\":\"Be-Bop High School\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1zxYYMySdNLxhwWjWQ25deVBv2w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rzvbiWvBtTdEUDIRiuFqQLdkKNV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At Aitoku High School, repeat sophomores Kōji Katō and Tōru Nakama are bruiser fighters who scorn any flashy titles. They pursue honor student Kyōko Izumi alongside their loyal crew. When rival gang leader Teru’s “bontan-gari” attacks sweep through the district, even Aitoku’s toughest, including Kintarō and Junpei, fall prey, until Kōji and Tōru themselves are targeted and Kyōko is kidnapped by Teru…\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844104,\"title\":\"Joriku\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8THUeEiIyKtzUM30vbnSX0rSNZb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/KcRnHBk7dC5Vb9Slx6pLTSz94b.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Former Olympic candidate Kaneda Musashi has been appointed coach of the women's track and field club at Tsukimi University. Meanwhile, Misaki Tono, the 100 meters ace there, is in a slump because she can't sprint due to her chest being too big…! With competition against a rival college just around the corner, can Musashi, a virgin track and field head, win the hearts of the female college students!?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"EwOeLYGPwRE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9MzzaurIBQI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dNvnDaIfR4A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}